  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Sexual Lovemaking for Dummies is an instruction manual for the romantically inclined, whether beginner or advanced. The subject of heterosexual coital possibilities has been thoroughly presented in text and image. Our test couple named 'Kirby' and 'Robin' divulge their coital insights using black and white photographs of contorted artists' wooden dummies to illustrate the various sexual positions. What at first glance appears to be an impersonal do-it-yourself manual is actually an intimate, sexually explicit discussion of one couple's shared pleasures, caring and tenderness.</subfield>
